      "writtenOn": "2024-02-13T21:01:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dichen,\nFew things that are needed in addition to this API at java level.\n\n- An equivalent API at NDK level\n- An API to clear the parameters queued so far\n\nFew things to be aligned/documented\n- What happens during flush?\n- Any limits to be placed on how many such parameters can be queued ahead.\n- Documentation on when this new API is to be used and when can the old one be used.\n- Any restrictions on how these APIs will co-exist?",
      "parentUuid": "c8da2650_d8f14829",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5061,
        "startChar": 0,
